# Recorded from host `swarminator` on 2026-08-20, where `lspci` reports two
# VGA compatible controllers (01:00.0 NVIDIA AD103, 79:00.0 AMD Raphael) and
# /sys/class/drm exposes card1, card2, their connectors, and two render nodes.
#
# The tree is stored as a manifest rather than as real directories because a
# PCI address contains a colon, which Windows cannot represent in a filename;
# checking such paths into the repository would break a Windows clone.
#
# Lines beginning with ">>> dir" or ">>> file" start an entry; everything up
# to the next entry is the file's content.

